{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10135290","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10135290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013529001:0":{"text":"그러고보니, 왜 이런 곳에 트라이브 남성이 나타난 거죠?","source_cn":"说起来，为什么在这里出现了一个蛮血男性？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF9250F48C0ADC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013529002:0":{"text":"오켄펠에서 본 적은 있는데, 이곳에도 있을 줄 몰랐어요. 게다가 어딘가 이상한 트라이브였고...","source_cn":"在奎城我倒是见过一些，没想到这里也有，还是个奇怪的蛮血……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6694A089042EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013529003:0":{"text":"그의 존재가 태양의 신전의 성물과 연관이 있을까요?","source_cn":"确实，他的存在会和日神殿的圣物有关吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E459555A743AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013529004:0":{"text":"의심스럽긴 하지만, 그 녀석의 머리로 음모를 꾸미긴 힘들 것 같다는 생각이 드네요...","source_cn":"虽然很可疑，但总觉得以那个家伙的脑袋而言，很难成为阴谋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FFE56EF1C90151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localize